      "rationale": "Niphal n נקה: YLT yesɛa 'hath been declared innocent' (yettwabbi d wid n Yisrael akken tella), imsuqalen nniḍen qqlen-t d 'ad yettwakkes\/ad yenger' — anamek n uswadu yettwaḥkem s temsalt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "מזה כמוה",
      "rationale": "D tuccḍa tamessant: 'seg uḥric-a, akken tella' — wangal n yiberdan-agi deg weḍris; imsuqalen qqaren d sin yiberdan n ugiṭun, neɣ d isemzal n tɣuri."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "פני",
      "rationale": "Isem n yiwet n tɣawsa imeẓyanen — panim n tmurt; yuɣal d 'wudmawen akk' deg umaḍal-agi."
    },
    {
      "kind": "mystery",
      "subject": "tameẓla",
      "rationale": "Tameẓla tamistigurt n lexder i d-ittuffɣen — d aḥric seg wallal ameskil n Zekarya, ayen yettwaffren."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Yenna-yi: Wagi d lexder i d-ittuffɣen ɣef wudmawen akk n tmurt, axaṭer win akk yettkelsen seg yiwen uḥric, ṭaq akken tella, ad yettunefk, d win akk yettqassen s yiḥric wayeḍ, ṭaq akken tella, ad yettunefk.",
